# This is a marker file consumed by TrustBridge-BE/start-all.{sh,ps1}, which
# requires a `.env` to exist at the root of each component directory. start-all
# copies this .env.example -> .env automatically when .env is missing (the real
# .env is gitignored, so fresh clones rely on this template).
#
# The cloud agent's REAL configuration lives at:
#   PoC_SDK_v3/sdk_cloud/application_PoC_MQTT/.env
# which is loaded by docker-compose.yml here via:
#   env_file: ./application_PoC_MQTT/.env
#
# Edit that file (not this one) to change cloud-agent settings.
